WEBVTT

00:03:27.903 --> 00:03:30.903
looking at me and telling me
I don't belong.

00:03:31.776 --> 00:03:35.101
And so I decided, 20-some-odd years later,

00:03:35.125 --> 00:03:37.569
to be the person
who got to open the gates.

00:03:38.085 --> 00:03:41.600
(Cheers)

00:03:41.624 --> 00:03:45.532
(Applause)

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:49.783
Unfortunately, you may have read
the rest of the story.

00:03:49.807 --> 00:03:51.544
It didn't quite work out that way.

00:03:51.568 --> 00:03:55.329
And now I'm tasked with figuring out:
How do I move forward?

00:03:55.953 --> 00:03:59.543
Because, you see, I didn't just want
to open the gates for young black women

00:03:59.567 --> 00:04:02.350
who had been underestimated
and told they don't belong.